Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commit/69d158c6ab3f0a458845125ce7fcf046f1cf470b","sha":"69d158c6ab3f0a458845125ce7fcf046f1cf470b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commits/69d158c6ab3f0a458845125ce7fcf046f1cf470b"}],"sha":"d2c1f93a2561a5b5eaecd7af0bfcc22bfb9344ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commits/d2c1f93a2561a5b5eaecd7af0bfcc22bfb9344ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7794387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gkrajniak","id":7794387,"login":"gkrajniak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQzODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commits/69d158c6ab3f0a458845125ce7fcf046f1cf470b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:00:21Z","email":"gkrajniak@gmail.com","name":"Grzegorz Krajniak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:00:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): bump Angular to 22.2 and resolve vulnerabilities (#736)\n\n## Summary\n\nResolves the open Dependabot alerts and the fixable `npm audit`\nfindings. The critical piscina and the @angular/router advisories need\nAngular 22.2, so the Angular dev dependencies move one minor version.\nPeer dependency ranges are unchanged.\n\n## Dependency bumps (devDependencies, exact pins kept)\n\n- @angular/common, compiler, compiler-cli, core, elements, forms,\nlocalize, platform-browser, platform-browser-dynamic, router 22.1.1 →\n22.2.1\n- @angular/build, @angular/cli 22.1.3 → 22.2.2\n\n## Lockfile updates (bump and `npm audit fix`)\n\n- piscina 5.2.0 → 5.3.2 (via @angular/build 22.2.2)\n- @angular/router 22.1.1 → 22.2.1\n- @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.29.0 removed (@angular/cli 22.2.2 uses\n@modelcontextprotocol/server 2.3.1); this also drops the express stack\nwith proxy-addr 2.0.7 and ip-address 10.5.0\n- shell-quote 1.10.0 → 1.12.0\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 → 1.2.2\n- fast-uri 3.1.7 → 3.1.8\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 → 1.1.21, 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Not fixable\n\n- braces 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm): no patched version published yet;\ndev only, via nodemon/chokidar\n\n## Verification\n\n`npm ci`, `npm install`, `npm run build` and `npm test` (459 + 83 tests)\npass.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"b73f8ddb5f5c6b03b59fc9a75dbd9bfabceefbb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/trees/b73f8ddb5f5c6b03b59fc9a75dbd9bfabceefbb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/commits/69d158c6ab3f0a458845125ce7fcf046f1cf470b","verification":{"payload":"tree b73f8ddb5f5c6b03b59fc9a75dbd9bfabceefbb0\nparent b88a3f48c66e74b4fe175e1a99ec88b35e5aa8a0\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1791363621 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791363621 +0400\n\nfix(deps): bump Angular to 22.2 and resolve vulnerabilities (#736)\n\n## Summary\n\nResolves the open Dependabot alerts and the fixable `npm audit`\nfindings. The critical piscina and the @angular/router advisories need\nAngular 22.2, so the Angular dev dependencies move one minor version.\nPeer dependency ranges are unchanged.\n\n## Dependency bumps (devDependencies, exact pins kept)\n\n- @angular/common, compiler, compiler-cli, core, elements, forms,\nlocalize, platform-browser, platform-browser-dynamic, router 22.1.1 →\n22.2.1\n- @angular/build, @angular/cli 22.1.3 → 22.2.2\n\n## Lockfile updates (bump and `npm audit fix`)\n\n- piscina 5.2.0 → 5.3.2 (via @angular/build 22.2.2)\n- @angular/router 22.1.1 → 22.2.1\n- @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.29.0 removed (@angular/cli 22.2.2 uses\n@modelcontextprotocol/server 2.3.1); this also drops the express stack\nwith proxy-addr 2.0.7 and ip-address 10.5.0\n- shell-quote 1.10.0 → 1.12.0\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 → 1.2.2\n- fast-uri 3.1.7 → 3.1.8\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 → 1.1.21, 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Not fixable\n\n- braces 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm): no patched version published yet;\ndev only, via nodemon/chokidar\n\n## Verification\n\n`npm ci`, `npm install`, `npm run build` and `npm test` (459 + 83 tests)\npass.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxgolCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxXMQAG5X3nIt6SOBwI2rqRgG3jdc\nS+AhYd/4v0uKypcrEZNX86buKYVsP7UC4Y3q2PiWgVAC3mL9NQGVPlm/BAd1MXEh\n9WTJjSCvsLnGene6GaOerTEO1OZgarD4M/hpVm9pzpT09Ipg8n/A4OY7Snj4y0PI\nEUr3wHJMNJ2iAAeeVhraR1kruipiYyrRcz92iviMcR0o5ojAmDz4QZtWB/FuYJ/a\nPXiFoY3ZELRXGWqrrwpzgu81q/Y+ssyl6N71X0epioTsAM0JCOCV5dXroVm+ai0n\nq1tP9z4GchPl716jGQgplb9C3oGIxQ/Lr/8jSFlARasr1X7XIWZj8nqKmeb7fa9B\nhP3UwumPQjvyvzfGyrByN3MuSr+dlhLz+SSPrlmVb2omoc4sjyyF6ePi8W9g3yT2\nc0S0Z/JBIBSi9lm3aDTzMG8PMmYosAzpgQncD2sskCsuVcbVTtB28gKTkgCDM2HD\n9eyDKerxuggYkEQLZyrCoJ1VpT3Sp69PEgkyZpggCvQRX7rFXRDyrNez20pYUz/D\nK1fsCRn8BeEP0Sg95tCklsEZVDWNNSw0jAgM4qQmYdBdwkRTcPS8KCp4RtVl6OdL\nZg9AEe0JLflryX9RbIorFIxylVS8dPEzzpXxglDkTtKfMxLISUb1XMsyZfehlf6D\nRLbi1pimy3X75pnPr4eL\n=dH+6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T09:00:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/pri