` | 4.13.2 → 4.13.7 | moderate | toSSG path traversal, parseBody\nmemory exhaustion, query parser fragment differential | @angular/cli →\n@modelcontextprotocol/sdk |\n| `qs` | 6.15.3 → 6.16.0 | moderate | array-limit bypass, DoS via\nisBuffer | @angular/cli → …/sdk → express |\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm audit` now reports **0 vulnerabilities**\n- `npm run build:lib` succeeds\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"db640ddce5bda019bde918af7be845f5120b2cf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/trees/db640ddce5bda019bde918af7be845f5120b2cf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/commits/0d1dd2c4e8f230b7532f777453456a897a7a1090","verification":{"payload":"tree db640ddce5bda019bde918af7be845f5120b2cf7\nparent 6ddf41d9b5e559032bd225c7d61d05aa4cc0310f\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1789126859 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789126859 +0400\n\nfix: resolve npm audit vulnerabilities in transitive dependencies (#711)\n\n## Summary\n\nRan `npm audit fix` to resolve 3 reported vulnerabilities (1 high, 2\nmoderate) in transitive build/dev dependencies. Only `package-lock.json`\nis affected — `package.json` is unchanged and no runtime dependencies of\nthe published library are involved.\n\n## Fixes\n\n| Package | Before → After | Severity | Advisory | Chain |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `fast-uri` | 3.1.5 → 3.1.7 | high | host confusion / SSRF | ng-packagr\n→ ajv |\n| `hono` | 4.13.2 → 4.13.7 | moderate | toSSG path traversal, parseBody\nmemory exhaustion, query parser fragment differential | @angular/cli →\n@modelcontextprotocol/sdk |\n| `qs` | 6.15.3 → 6.16.0 | moderate | array-limit bypass, DoS via\nisBuffer | @angular/cli → …/sdk → express |\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm audit` now reports **0 vulnerabilities**\n- `npm run build:lib` succeeds\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo