","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openmfp-technical-user","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commit/2d276d720d27084839b7045274564101b27eee45","node_id":"C_kwDOMUAz8doAKDJkMjc2ZDcyMGQyNzA4NDgzOWI3MDQ1Mjc0NTY0MTAxYjI3ZWVlNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commit/3d793783adc9bd64bdee75f132cd85370fc158e2","sha":"3d793783adc9bd64bdee75f132cd85370fc158e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commits/3d793783adc9bd64bdee75f132cd85370fc158e2"}],"sha":"2d276d720d27084839b7045274564101b27eee45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commits/2d276d720d27084839b7045274564101b27eee45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247634500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friedrichstefan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friedrichstefan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friedrichstefan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friedrichstefan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/friedrichstefan","id":247634500,"login":"friedrichstefan","node_id":"U_kgDODsKaRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friedrichstefan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friedrichstefan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friedrichstefan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friedrichstefan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friedrichstefan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/friedrichstefan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commits/3d793783adc9bd64bdee75f132cd85370fc158e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:44:46Z","email":"friedrich.stef@icloud.com","name":"Stefan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:44:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add per-URL active toggle to development mode settings (#691)\n\nCloses Issue https://github.com/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/issues/633 by SAP\n\n## Problem\n\nIn the development mode URL list, users had to remove and re-add URLs\nwhenever they wanted to temporarily disable one. There was no way to\nkeep a URL in the list while preventing it from being loaded.\n\n## Changes\n- Added `active?: boolean` to the `Config` model (backward compatible)\n- `ui5-switch` toggle added to each list item — inactive URLs are grayed\nout\n- Inactive URLs are skipped when fetching configurations\n- New URLs default to `active: true`\n- Fixed responsive layout for long URLs\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n- Added switches to enable or disable local development configuration\nURLs.\n  - Disabled entries are visually indicated and excluded from loading.\n- Existing configurations without an active status remain compatible and\nload normally.\n  - Active states are saved when changed.\n- **UI Improvements**\n- Improved configuration list layout, long-URL handling, and\ninactive-entry styling.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: I767513 <stefan.friedrich01@sap.com>\nSigned-off-by: Stefan <friedrich.stef@icloud.com>\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Stefan Friedrich <friedrich.stef@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: I767513 <stefan.friedrich01@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"913fac74e29a0a718302de32d5554e92fc29908b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/trees/913fac74e29a0a718302de32d5554e92fc29908b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/commits/3d793783adc9bd64bdee75f132cd85370fc158e2","verification":{"payload":"tree 913fac74e29a0a718302de32d5554e92fc29908b\nparent 02f0ef0375c6664b88a6481dc689ec7af9ce91d1\nauthor Stefan <friedrich.stef@icloud.com> 1787838286 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787838286 +0200\n\nfeat: add per-URL active toggle to development mode settings (#691)\n\nCloses Issue https://github.com/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/issues/633 by SAP\n\n## Problem\n\nIn the development mode URL list, users had to remove and re-add URLs\nwhenever they wanted to temporarily disable one. There was no way to\nkeep a URL in the list while preventing it from being loaded.\n\n## Changes\n- Added `active?: boolean` to the `Config` model (backward compatible)\n- `ui5-switch` toggle added to each list item — inactive URLs are grayed\nout\n- Inactive URLs are skipped when fetching configurations\n- New URLs default to `active: true`\n- Fixed responsive layout for long URLs\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n- Added switches to enable or disable local development configuration\nURLs.\n  - Disabled entries are visually indicated and excluded from loading.\n- Existing configurations without an active status remain compatible and\nload normally.\n  - Active states are saved when changed.\n- **UI Improvements**\n- Improved configuration list layout, long-URL handling, and\ninactive-entry styling.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: I767513 <stefan.friedrich01@sap.com>\nSigned-off-by: Stefan <friedrich.stef@icloud.com>\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Stefan Friedrich <friedrich.stef@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: I767513 <stefan.friedrich01@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Grzegorz Kr