t":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T12:20:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add default error screens (not-found, not-authorized, unexpected) (#692)\n\nCloses #659\n\n## Summary\nPortals no longer need to implement their own error UIs. Three default\nscreens are now available out of the box via `providePortal()`:\n\n- `/error/not-found`\n- `/error/not-authorized`  \n- `/error/unexpected`\n\nEach shows a SAP icon, translated title/subtitle and a \"Go Home\" button.\nEN + DE translations included.\n\nAlso fixes pre-existing Vitest infrastructure issues that prevented the\ntest suite from running (0 → 488 tests passing).\n\n## Breaking changes\nNone — purely additive.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added localized error screens for not-found, unauthorized, and\nunexpected errors.\n* Added contextual icons, messages, expandable error details, and a\nbutton to return home.\n  * Added English and German translations.\n  * Exposed the error screen for use throughout the library.\n\n* **Tests**\n* Expanded coverage for error-screen behavior, navigation, localization,\nand error-code handling.\n  * Improved browser-environment test setup and cleanup.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: I767513 <stefan.friedrich01@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: I767513 <stefan.friedrich01@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"63d8d855c85f2655ca48491c8478eb3375cc0a55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/trees/63d8d855c85f2655ca48491c8478eb3375cc0a55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/commits/55095bbb76b828b7c17730a2093fbdd07c1941d4","verification":{"payload":"tree 63d8d855c85f2655ca48491c8478eb3375cc0a55\nparent 55f2ef4bbb3b2385088f6b27d0aaa9e3f6256d84\nauthor Stefan <friedrich.stef@icloud.com> 1787055602 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787055602 +0200\n\nAdd default error screens (not-found, not-authorized, unexpected) (#692)\n\nCloses #659\n\n## Summary\nPortals no longer need to implement their own error UIs. Three default\nscreens are now available out of the box via `providePortal()`:\n\n- `/error/not-found`\n- `/error/not-authorized`  \n- `/error/unexpected`\n\nEach shows a SAP icon, translated title/subtitle and a \"Go Home\" button.\nEN + DE translations included.\n\nAlso fixes pre-existing Vitest infrastructure issues that prevented the\ntest suite from running (0 → 488 tests passing).\n\n## Breaking changes\nNone — purely additive.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added localized error screens for not-found, unauthorized, and\nunexpected errors.\n* Added contextual icons, messages, expandable error details, and a\nbutton to return home.\n  * Added English and German translations.\n  * Exposed the error screen for use throughout the library.\n\n* **Tests**\n* Expanded coverage for error-screen behavior, navigation, localization,\nand error-code handling.\n  * Improved browser-environment test setup and cleanup.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: I767513 <stefan.friedrich01@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: I767513 <stefan.friedrich01@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhE3yCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsvgQADgci/ttLxQqUKvHf0KSBYXx\ngOGt9Y2aFYliQ+d2HmcvQvwJMj3Yl77QckHFKg68A7Lfb0pbhrY7Uc7lMTRa1nsn\n8+gJIiUjMAlPhbUgLfQjfGG8va3dg399gb5tTbunQg885jhTVQMUm00KtjJ26IOc\nJ96WtIqVB31O7mZ2kGTLHLr1x8tjqbjXIgy7QJyuCeGeAUZ6MMnwMCimiFrHtQ6M\nBJRgDm/bS5GmSfHzPzm9XWTrJoQ7ob2YznyDP6R308kGQarrfDZzQ1/gyqwfcGut\nX4kZeqBw8NshVAJxpYhhpZvi7Te+ZVbWkwteNqOASzyZhtVyL7wWSYGhf3FK/ohX\nB7sFXUI01HhiYR6nnvFUqmXyrTFE0x0ZGfh8ClzwQ/lQI