j-holub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j-holub","id":19982919,"login":"j-holub","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTgyOTE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-holub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-holub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-holub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-holub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-holub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-holub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commits/1f5ea6175923f7f63c65f9e01dd28c09cc2902d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T07:57:21Z","email":"Jan-Holub@gmx.net","name":"Jan Holub"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T07:57:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: replace outdated jmespath with @jmespath-community/jmespath [DXPFRAME-2504] (#695)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Replace unmaintained `jmespath@0.16.0` (last published Jan 2022) with\nactively maintained `@jmespath-community/jmespath@1.3.0`\n- Remove `@types/jmespath` devDependency (community fork has built-in\nTypeScript types)\n- Add backwards-compatible shim (`transformLegacyBacktickLiterals`) that\nauto-converts legacy backtick syntax so downstream consumers don''t need\nimmediate changes\n- Deprecation warning logged once per unique legacy expression to guide\nmigration\n\n## Breaking Change Mitigation\n\nThe community fork requires valid JSON inside backtick literals (``\n`\"admin\"` `` instead of `` `admin` ``). The shim transparently handles\nthis conversion at runtime, preserving full backwards compatibility. A\nconsole warning nudges consumers to update their expressions over time.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] All existing tests pass without modification (validates backwards\ncompatibility)\n- [ ] New unit tests for `transformLegacyBacktickLiterals` cover: no\nbackticks, unquoted strings, valid JSON passthrough, multiple literals,\nspecial characters\n- [ ] `context.spec.ts` test with legacy `` `admin` `` syntax passes via\nthe shim\n- [ ] Library builds without TypeScript errors\n- [ ] Branch coverage remains above 90% threshold\n\n## Links\n\n- [DXPFRAME-2504: Replace outdated\ndependencies](https://sap.atlassian.net/browse/DXPFRAME-2504)\n- PR-#694: fix: replace outdated lodash.ismatch and lodash.isequal with\ninline utilities\n\nSigned-off-by: Jan Holub <jan.holub@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca1ccc018763cb8406dd3ebb2e4506ac66744903","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/trees/ca1ccc018763cb8406dd3ebb2e4506ac66744903"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/commits/1f5ea6175923f7f63c65f9e01dd28c09cc2902d8","verification":{"payload":"tree ca1ccc018763cb8406dd3ebb2e4506ac66744903\nparent 51c2eb596c000afc55376eefa83e7b7fe0e506f3\nauthor Jan Holub <Jan-Holub@gmx.net> 1786694241 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786694241 +0200\n\nfix: replace outdated jmespath with @jmespath-community/jmespath [DXPFRAME-2504] (#695)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Replace unmaintained `jmespath@0.16.0` (last published Jan 2022) with\nactively maintained `@jmespath-community/jmespath@1.3.0`\n- Remove `@types/jmespath` devDependency (community fork has built-in\nTypeScript types)\n- Add backwards-compatible shim (`transformLegacyBacktickLiterals`) that\nauto-converts legacy backtick syntax so downstream consumers don''t need\nimmediate changes\n- Deprecation warning logged once per unique legacy expression to guide\nmigration\n\n## Breaking Change Mitigation\n\nThe community fork requires valid JSON inside backtick literals (``\n`\"admin\"` `` instead of `` `admin` ``). The shim transparently handles\nthis conversion at runtime, preserving full backwards compatibility. A\nconsole warning nudges consumers to update their expressions over time.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] All existing tests pass without modification (validates backwards\ncompatibility)\n- [ ] New unit tests for `transformLegacyBacktickLiterals` cover: no\nbackticks, unquoted strings, valid JSON passthrough, multiple literals,\nspecial characters\n- [ ] `context.spec.ts` test with legacy `` `admin` `` syntax passes via\nthe shim\n- [ ] Library builds without TypeScript errors\n- [ ] Branch coverage remains above 90% threshold\n\n## Links\n\n- [DXPFRAME-2504: Replace outdated\ndependencies](https://sap.atlassian.net/browse/DXPFRAME-2504)\n- PR-#694: fix: replace outdated lodash.ismatch and lodash.isequal with\ninline utilities\n\nSigned-off-by: Jan Holub <jan.holub@sap.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfsphCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGD8QAIvt0QfwUpLnzsthsK7moC81\ntN+MOxFZefNWpuQUfPjtH9Zx4Z1UBiR+qtK38HZ3+o6SeYqndqLxi9wPVpTb6Vas\n7GLDDZrjDhlLupika12xG7OJtGwyeLACMkZvbH2OAe/Jv5AQdqJKcBRau0dn6fWW\nEDZjJ/7/zjksUMJue6nHHBxTQK3pvMzLKwMTTHTlQ/Ai3bFgmw1+oF0SfUsMGS1E\n7C2bbfo1F/r62+pqSKeliHgpF7jodOPZ5fRs5iXtyQJYwIt9w8AI/PVeRvvpob8W\ndIj9+YQbHJ6cz7C13Wokio+jryL0+TVE2ISymDvgWXrXIRe8XOKb+uEAjbzxsynU\n//WJJA+/FE2qhTI98vIz60U+Uu8G98X1m2rK8RFhzeWmbKliXJOzafDmxWj+mSM4\nY2lEtQe757Qo0yjSN+XAdRnldEBBkSarMRzcH2fRGMmqUUk/Hof52cCEbEXthDmZ\nVcRPfleWK0l6MMvCP6669FO7sHN/4Prx09hzpUweCLNAM+w5yAJNNzjKs5JVAGsT\nEksvr7XL3Zu9RMW4Y4NzdO5Z8SdcjRCoTbjUqpYdqCNu6ra+EToJP7yD96NqQlFS\nWZlz3xKRwKcmk0sELsuwYGx6pDdsnGlexsxnOcvlWsKNeqqMLS9MpUAe7C55uVRV\nNxJoFDXSzuMMOLsJ6EK0\n=fz4A\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T07:57:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19