,"user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commit/315e4658794ccea0ba34b151cdb7bb67b6fd4114","node_id":"C_kwDOMUAz8doAKDMxNWU0NjU4Nzk0Y2NlYTBiYTM0YjE1MWNkYjdiYjY3YjZmZDQxMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commit/13920151291838f4b5b3d4080aa682b6896e061f","sha":"13920151291838f4b5b3d4080aa682b6896e061f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commits/13920151291838f4b5b3d4080aa682b6896e061f"}],"sha":"315e4658794ccea0ba34b151cdb7bb67b6fd4114","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commits/315e4658794ccea0ba34b151cdb7bb67b6fd4114"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14194923?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anastazya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anastazya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anastazya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anastazya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anastazya","id":14194923,"login":"anastazya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk0OTIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anastazya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anastazya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anastazya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anastazya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anastazya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anastazya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/commits/13920151291838f4b5b3d4080aa682b6896e061f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T11:51:09Z","email":"anastazya@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Theodor Ganescu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T11:51:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: signal expiry and drop stale auth data when the session refresh fails (#683)\n\n## Problem\n\nWhen the session can no longer be refreshed (SSO session ended, refresh\ntoken invalid), `/rest/auth/refresh` answers `201` with an **empty\nbody** (portal-server-lib''s `AuthController.refresh()` returns\n`undefined` after `handleAuthError`). On the client,\n`setAuthData(undefined)` keeps the old auth data and\n`SessionRefreshService.refresh()` returned silently:\n\n```ts\nconst isRefreshed = await this.authService.refresh();\nif (!isRefreshed) return;\n```\n\nNo event is fired and no re-login is triggered, so the user keeps an\nexpired token and every API call 401s until a manual reload. Verified\nlive: healthy refresh = 201 + full token JSON; after the Keycloak\nsession is deleted = 201 + 0 bytes, silently swallowed.\n\n## Change\n\nOn a failed refresh, fire the existing `AuthEvent.AUTH_EXPIRED` and\nremove the auth data via `LuigiCoreService.removeAuthData()`, so the\nalready-existing expiry handling (redirect to login with the return URL\nsaved) takes over.\n\n## Tests\n\nThe previous spec *\"should not successfully refresh the session\"*\nasserted that nothing happens on a failed refresh — it codified the bug.\nIt is replaced by *\"should signal expiry and drop stale auth data when\nthe refresh fails\"*, which fails on the unpatched code. Full suite green\n(392 lib + 70 wc).\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n* Improved handling when session refresh fails by notifying the\napplication that the session has expired.\n  * Cleared stored authentication data after an unsuccessful refresh.\n* Preserved authentication data when refresh attempts fail due to an\nerror.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Andrian Krautsou <117839500+Sobyt483@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ab7d8ac93f9ed4f0c7efc1213b16dbffe79f0f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/trees/5ab7d8ac93f9ed4f0c7efc1213b16dbffe79f0f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-ui-lib/git/commits/13920151291838f4b5b3d4080aa682b6896e061f","verification":{"payload":"tree 5ab7d8ac93f9ed4f0c7efc1213b16dbffe79f0f6\nparent 0990a0bc03553592c1f49f753f7a4f66f9344bab\nauthor Theodor Ganescu <anastazya@users.noreply.github.com> 1785757869 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785757869 +0000\n\nfix: signal expiry and drop stale auth data when the session refresh fails (#683)\n\n## Problem\n\nWhen the session can no longer be refreshed (SSO session ended, refresh\ntoken invalid), `/rest/auth/refresh` answers `201` with an **empty\nbody** (portal-server-lib''s `AuthController.refresh()` returns\n`undefined` after `handleAuthError`). On the client,\n`setAuthData(undefined)` keeps the old auth data and\n`SessionRefreshService.refresh()` returned silently:\n\n```ts\nconst isRefreshed = await this.authService.refresh();\nif (!isRefreshed) return;\n```\n\nNo event is fired and no re-login is triggered, so the user keeps an\nexpired token and every API call 401s until a manual reload. Verified\nlive: healthy refresh = 201 + full token JSON; after the Keycloak\nsession is deleted = 201 + 0 bytes, silently swallowed.\n\n## Change\n\nOn a failed refresh, fire the existing `AuthEvent.AUTH_EXPIRED` and\nremove the auth data via `LuigiCoreService.removeAuthData()`, so the\nalready-existing expiry handling (redirect to login with the return URL\nsaved) takes over.\n\n## Tests\n\nThe previous spec *\"should not successfully refresh the session\"*\nasserted that nothing happens on a failed refresh — it codified the bug.\nIt is replaced by *\"should signal expiry and drop stale auth data when\nthe refresh fails\"*, which fails on the unpatched code. Full suite green\n(392 lib + 70 wc).\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n* Improved handling when session refresh fails by notifying the\napplication that the session has expired.\n  * Cleared stored authentication data after an unsuccessful refresh.\n* Preserved authentication data when refresh attempts fail due to an\nerror.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Andrian Krautsou <117839500+Sobyt483@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcICtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWEIQAKElAwb9kDl4o9qMdessxZ/2\nDNnlRjgc/UCLB0X8PC+BYBDfXtOtFWu4ZvbAZvBSJAhaBRquonxNIkgrThpwQlkO\n9AwUemCg+dCLrGjM8EMRmhZMhVt2jjngRb/GqgKnyzs4nTmTImnThL5n+/4p//+Y\n+aJhHN6ej27VB8wdBxfawG+tXUEBDsNV4MMN5ilda8EsyUb8JAl/qorrcvRxZhLK\nVIEJNdQ28LNQ/tDpA26utcyC39n3KDBxY6LunxAS9JclnuhSO4Pfzf3hyo2LGuCb\nuDc6rfTBW+lyGfNf+H5EP20NbT5QmPUDL2KtnMAyrWNakn45cMeFeL+d1D9U49vb\nP6l0d7I0Amxm5da/CVTu7DLxMuHabMcpj5QA54N4rsThl+ZDHRlqnu1jcZD6vDpr\nNcnPGz52ADzy5f0SmdDPuH75L3WkkYi2qgJ/IzJ+h6X7jtJ/0vxZ2wRXm9KN/YJE\nzoBZDcNA79+keT5RWsY+xapymbSYi/kMycHgw1IiRj3NA3dWazpXGdlU2Lck0p4v\nZylVQsxNFhA381gy/9LeR3JFYohc5ooNIVN93NFPyVhCncLCyDCoS9oZzSL17+X6\nOMSbJXkejkSd5OWZrRjHBV+K0TADSsl3F6MlH9Km65Ptepyq6SB26tJxgqVGoaSB\nCc+8x9MLRkCJ0pxhT3F5\n=q6aj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-03T11:51:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","