.github.com/repos/module-federation/tauri-plugin-module-federation/git/commits/e1c8ad4f4f5b8ac631e129310e2b45267edea995","verification":{"payload":"tree d81eca590a880546a91d6be31ef5e1efba055dfa\nparent 6b1ca382a3fec75d139c2eaf3e66bb676665d5bb\nauthor Jakub Romanczyk <j.romanczyk@gmail.com> 1775733495 +0200\ncommitter Jakub Romanczyk <j.romanczyk@gmail.com> 1775733495 +0200\n\nfix(example): ensure guest dev servers are ready before host starts\n\nThe host Tauri app panics when guest dev servers aren''t available yet,\nbecause the module-federation URI handler hits an unimplemented!() path\nwhen both the network fetch and disk cache fail. Sequence the dev script\nso guests are confirmed serving before the host launches.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAhcAAAAHc3NoLXJzYQAAAAMBAAEAAAIBAMri98DSgXwy1mb0D9sBhH\nc1bNN/zVpRQYUjfBstVPR3J9NcTmwx4nV52c7Z1DxumgVXaHpZ5j/0uOTN0Z47Y1uI3hzy\nknhjM9bldIHM1hcb7t1dUFLJdV/OeX9ECXYT0qtsyJ7E/V4w+A/hUztfx95Jt7BHTwfha2\ntYx6G3boL2pf/lAdv8dFfKR83KQhlUxdnm4kmYj5TeZB1II9/VnzHtyPTMUKXhfhcP8SKC\n8qiLoXO9cRlUxGh4Aghhs8eZFAxJmSJTNh98g0HEa/lDDEAvZWa7CIa/S9TtEY8U11lWOD\nxdD2mHqD4HRHjFyvp/p6tTPSzn2CSiOGkiaIBP2Is0ZLnRNMtKN4E9q9VJkS0CgCtEccqb\nv5svfg9Lc32n+10QuAEBR3ej2zPYu6i7anb3QBk6JE5bjwPAwf7b5OI/RjJupYBRiRG50i\n4/wpmqLPDZGITaQFcmWg1CKYBd+E0kMpBlFHDI6fT8Y7NIjfTbPrRq7M9eJKUL1I4iuaj+\nH6iiqTMym5k93fSG1DN/VA0SYbiAYKeAnR5N9aCY5zsrqfePqkEdKQjsc8HMDq7qbiJH5p\n90M8jqnAuV9v/MMGL7GQhqzWt0vLR7TtUi2hIQKg1iz62TVy8dnijtW/HuMcGcytwBBmVt\nGel7cqRSF8SICcAwk8OZ1KwRjZmZmFd7AAAAA2dpdAAAAAAAAAAGc2hhNTEyAAACFAAAAA\nxyc2Etc2hhMi01MTIAAAIAN5fuNuibDFrT7+IJWRwesA8/UV13bsba+0MNyrBmF8FtuUlW\nPby3gMXY0vWmJdyW0uPhLaam8TM+Hn1coYq7Dt3c0Heo+p1stPd3ZW+CkMxJltOy/NR4+B\nXyhgaSBbbGOjMTpTAeGCqFCoirv2xvhsLecATZXVSVaFdv6GmHggqBPvrIsic4goVcNOfr\nYosjlqSjw8lC6PE8mEc1V0Kq4WWDDRj/ThoNWUr4Vqgl0KnxWK4E+clfoFV0/Hd8Xa7SWx\nvnf7YdTOVAizGElDTYub8lYG32jjZYDXpTbQOgyTtJ5gy3QQRKTlxCAnl8Ted9Hq4M5hy9\nm2Xnk6Urje3VIdjM9OFwUnqjT5mMzUFhS/TOhAROmOo3zys1XrFShQhJ