id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MadiroGlobalHealth/openmrs-esm-lime/commits/9630c8a04910a16ae64d8963a9f0582a1c2deab9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-05T10:33:00Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-05T10:33:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(chore) Update core tooling and dependencies (#34)\n\nThis PR does the following:\n\n- Downgrades React to 18.2.0 and updates webpack ecosystem (`webpack`, `webpack-cli`, `webpack-dev-server`) to align with OpenMRS core\n- Updates SCSS imports from `@import` to recommended `@use` syntax to fix webpack build warnings\n- Updates core OpenMRS tooling to latest versions:\n  - `openmrs`\n  - `@openmrs/esm-framework`\n  - `@openmrs/esm-form-engine-lib`\n  - `@openmrs/esm-patient-common-lib`\n- Removes ambient type declarations for `react-aria` (fixed upstream in OpenMRS core)\n- Adjusts `i18next` and `rxjs` versions to match OpenMRS core\n- Removes `webpack-cli` resolution override in package.json\n\nThis change aligns dependency versions across the project and updates build tooling to the latest recommended versions.","tree":{"sha":"876e20cf3421de5c5823383ce42939a393a1ae8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MadiroGlobalHealth/openmrs-esm-lime/git/trees/876e20cf3421de5c5823383ce42939a393a1ae8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MadiroGlobalHealth/openmrs-esm-lime/git/commits/9630c8a04910a16ae64d8963a9f0582a1c2deab9","verification":{"payload":"tree 876e20cf3421de5c5823383ce42939a393a1ae8a\nparent a074d2be7024caa59401413419ae3370b80a4547\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1749119580 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1749119580 -0700\n\n(chore) Update core tooling and dependencies (#34)\n\nThis PR does the following:\n\n- Downgrades React to 18.2.0 and updates webpack ecosystem (`webpack`, `webpack-cli`, `webpack-dev-server`) to align with OpenMRS core\n- Updates SCSS imports from `@import` to recommended `@use` syntax to fix webpack build warnings\n- Updates core OpenMRS tooling to latest versions:\n  - `openmrs`\n  - `@openmrs/esm-framework`\n  - `@openmrs/esm-form-engine-lib`\n  - `@openmrs/esm-patient-common-lib`\n- Removes ambient type declarations for `react-aria` (fixed upstream in OpenMRS core)\n- Adjusts `i18next` and `rxjs` versions to match OpenMRS core\n- Removes `webpack-cli` resolution override in package.json\n\nThis change aligns dependency versions across the project and updates build tooling to the latest recommended versions.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoQXJcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQFwQACxHs5+gtV7ZprDa6c20CwVO\nVWJDu13KskH0LN4pfu8ZrsXEvKn/fU1Ff1b0LjJZLFhKt6n1EH6BHT+Hi67HW/XO\nWfgj5oftHAlvbYUONWZ1BxvoP8xY3HLWKdCUkFgX9N+qILJmA6GtW8QP+Tj1SMCd\nY8UhA6hNIJD1yfvZKbwlDRi4LYKdQw0s9ZgBaqhNl/RJFfwCPYWW+W+TunaZGv2z\nvEpUnCN1Sfj5CJQfZv13RroJ9MU+gAil4Ztw+lcos0xXsmFyJJQDRbia0p6x9KkM\nvywcROGJvA0evMdzgyZjvFH4D+lGK9T7MzFZQ6cn4k2AEhfF7IUQyvdS9v//LbRH\nrxvdBxkiwRCfP19tVGZbe54CrdzwmviTbl11OsnC8Ho2kRQoluYiFHnVEceQjw+f\nR0OQkqU3CcvyAzljW7VZOH4NWW2UlMNX2UBNITuUXDpIIdn3Wf123EjigBtMGud7\n3AQO32Q3Rxn2qQ6KfsKFIIYSx5FQJZee2tlZ7dt840Y29k2L7QQYdS9whjy3PXOT\nLZQebdwqLmA1fe77m45jhbukmtimMFiEgtmpWxHpQAH2iMkFASZmd+jvSvpEPTHW\nb6d6JJzFbrNK6VziRrhyOExlJ936b6qA3TknySWP8HpFlzDTnWHWuVLrfdyS6ys0\nYc6e7V04h/HnT55hbtJP\n=Hu99\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-06-05T10:38:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"http