users/RevenBot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RevenBot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RevenBot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RevenBot/Demo/commits/fbbab80b9d731f0fdda226f796a1fdfb2fb34aa3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T14:15:41Z","email":"kevinjss97@gmail.com","name":"Kevin Sinchi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T14:48:52Z","email":"kevinjss97@gmail.com","name":"Kevin Sinchi"},"message":":spiral_notepad: Fix critical bugs and add ProductService service layer\n\nBug fixes:\n- PUT /api/reservations now validates null request body before passing to service (returns 400)\n- DELETE /api/reservations null-check moved before property access to avoid NullReferenceException\n- Removed dead ProductExists() stubs from RestaurantsController and ReservationsController\n- Removed invalid DbSet.Update() calls from ReservationService and RestaurantService\n- Removed DebugView console logging from service layer\n\nNew ProductService layer:\n- Created IProductService interface and ProductService implementation\n- Refactored ProductsController to use IService dependency instead of ApplicationDbContext directly\n- Registered IProductService as scoped in Program.cs\n\nOrganization:\n- Moved WeatherForecast.cs into Models/ folder for consistency\n- Added WSL2 launch profile for local development","tree":{"sha":"842a1624907409d9de8985b400f82387bf011c4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RevenBot/Demo/git/trees/842a1624907409d9de8985b400f82387bf011c4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RevenBot/Demo/git/commits/fbbab80b9d731f0fdda226f796a1fdfb2fb34aa3","verification":{"payload":"tree 842a1624907409d9de8985b400f82387bf011c4f\nparent 357a455c56bc3266ef8f7e6a12c6ec3289a410de\nauthor Kevin Sinchi <kevinjss97@gmail.com> 1782828941 +0200\ncommitter Kevin Sinchi <kevinjss97@gmail.com> 1782830932 +0200\n\n:spiral_notepad: Fix critical bugs and add ProductService service layer\n\nBug fixes:\n- PUT /api/reservations now validates null request body before passing to service (returns 400)\n- DELETE /api/reservations null-check moved before property access to avoid NullReferenceException\n- Removed dead ProductExists() stubs from RestaurantsController and ReservationsController\n- Removed invalid DbSet.Update() calls from ReservationService and RestaurantService\n- Removed DebugView console logging from service layer\n\nNew ProductService layer:\n- Created IProductService interface and ProductService implementation\n- Refactored ProductsController to use IService dependency instead of ApplicationDbContext directly\n- Registered IProductService as scoped in Program.cs\n\nOrganization:\n- Moved WeatherForecast.cs into Models/ folder for consistency\n- Added WSL2 launch profile for local development\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmpkyq4/H7yBFpWiqLhGiyJ6YYN\nMUiHGCfPqAbr3WIR8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMKIsdEoEPuhZIglGrQfWT4ic0zlDLRD93g89FJW3kVlfptA2ShCJV6fjaSezmQTcJ\n3nWIYws0T+Mql8ThwC/wo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-02T22:03:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83868719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RevenBot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RevenBot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RevenBot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RevenBot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RevenBot","id":83868719,"login":"RevenBot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODY4NzE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RevenBot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RevenBot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RevenBot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github