xempt Phase 0 from the record\n\nDesign revision 7, answering the review of #23.\n\n- D-13: Pages is build_type legacy from main:/docs and serves the tracked\n  tree as committed, so a file generated in deploy-pages.yml is never\n  published. llms.txt and llms-full.txt are generated and committed into\n  docs/. Their raw links pin the last commit that changed cookbook/ or\n  guides/, which the commit adding the files does not change; CI checks\n  out full history and regenerates them to compare. Switching Pages to\n  workflow mode was considered and not taken.\n- D-12: the CI-enforced verified.json applies from Phase 1 on. Phase 0\n  touches no recipe and precedes the runner.\n- Phase 0 is complete (#23); its table check now covers every page that\n  lists the cyweb/*Api exposes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0e06bca12e83e76664915a3a0ae7aab16ae77db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/d0e06bca12e83e76664915a3a0ae7aab16ae77db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/d1998b170a122e8905c3d13e4adbf3ad62f13175","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/st