://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/2b0b3386d5a2b92ac586143f379a834fdaafaed5","node_id":"C_kwDOMaT2ftoAKDJiMGIzMzg2ZDVhMmI5MmFjNTg2MTQzZjM3OWE4MzRmZGFhZmFlZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/9bcef507fc077e448cd80577662c974a1a34d2e4","sha":"9bcef507fc077e448cd80577662c974a1a34d2e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/9bcef507fc077e448cd80577662c974a1a34d2e4"}],"sha":"2b0b3386d5a2b92ac586143f379a834fdaafaed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/2b0b3386d5a2b92ac586143f379a834fdaafaed5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/9bcef507fc077e448cd80577662c974a1a34d2e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:50:44Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:50:44Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"docs: correct what agents read before the cookbook links to it\n\nCookbook Phase 0. Every fix below was checked against the host''s\norigin/development.\n\n- README: the event table gains network:changed, network:loaded and\n  style:switched; the API table gains cyweb/PanelApi, cyweb/AppDataApi\n  and cyweb/ScopedApi. Non-React access awaits CyWebApi.whenReady()\n  instead of the one-shot cywebapi:ready event, and says that\n  window.CyWebApi''s contextMenu, nodeGraphics and panel are not tied to\n  an app.\n- hello-world LayoutSection: applyLayout never rejects, and\n  layout:completed fires on success only, just before the Promise\n  resolves. The comment said the opposite of both, and the .catch()\n  existed for a rejection that cannot happen.\n- The host menu is \"Manage Apps...\", not \"App Settings\": README, three\n  guides, four app READMEs.\n- `npm run dev:local` is the same command as `npm run dev` in the host;\n  its dev server always serves apps.local.json.\n- hello-world README: drop three files the SDK migration deleted, the\n  copy-the-template recipe (now a pointer to npm create cytoscape-app),\n  and stale duplicate API and event tables (one claimed image export;\n  now pointers to the repository README).\n- troubleshooting: vi.mock, not jest.mock, in a Vitest repository.\n- lessons.md: no remotes.d.ts, ports live in each app''s cyweb block, and\n  prefer the *Api hooks over the legacy *Store exposes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ae1b34b9ebeeccbf4fc8416e0ef63fa54060f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/4ae1b34b9ebeeccbf4fc8416e0ef63fa54060f3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/9bcef507fc077e448cd80577662c974a1a34d2e4","verification":{"payload":