ro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:22:55Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"docs(cookbook): grow the catalog to 25 recipes and record a backlog\n\nSix recipes join Phase 2, following the Cytoscape Desktop tutorials\n(Importing Network From Table, Importing Data From Tables, Filtering by\nSelection, Basic Data Visualization): create-network-from-table,\nsubnetwork-from-selection, join-table-by-key, set-style-defaults,\nemphasize-by-threshold and hide-by-threshold. node-context-menu becomes\nlink-out-from-node, select-neighbors takes a hop count, and\nadd-computed-column uses degree as its example.\n\nThe rest goes in a new design section 4.12: seven planned recipes, four\nthat need a feasibility check, and the API gaps that cannot be recipes\n(image export, zoom to selection, layout of the selection only, groups).\nA backlog recipe enters the catalog only with a passing case (D-11).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5abbb5b46f20c301d2b1a7c836e0e75ccb64123","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/c5abbb5b46f20c301d2b1a7c836e0e75ccb64123"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/420caeb89fc054634bc4e0900e39c34193728e57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/420caeb89fc054634bc4e0900e39c34193728e57","node_id":"C_kwDOMaT2ftoAKDQyMGNhZWI4OWZjMDU0NjM0YmM0ZTA5MDBlMzljMzQxOTM3MjhlNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/9fa59a078b2f6a6cc12332f46166b2371d659acd","sha":"9fa59a078b2f6a6cc12332f46166b2371d659acd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/9fa59a078b2f6a6cc12332f46166b2371d659acd"}],"sha":"420caeb89fc054634bc4e0900e39c34193728e57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/420caeb89fc054634bc4e0900e39c34193728e57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-exa