mit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T23:49:50Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T23:49:50Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"Move network-workflows to port 7001\n\nmacOS''s AirPlay Receiver (ControlCenter) listens on 7000, so on a Mac\nwith it turned on the network-workflows dev server cannot bind there and\ndev-start.sh refuses to start it. The `cyweb` block in package.json is the\none source of the port; the scaffolder''s reserved ports and their test,\nthe READMEs, the design documents and the agent notes follow. The host''s\napps.local.json moves in the same change on the cytoscape-web side.\n\nThe Vite-migration inventory keeps 7000: it records the state at the time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e360b474107a8d576095546fd59d71594c85de7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/e360b474107a8d576095546fd59d71594c85de7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/ab64f18f426f6b66f333cb6e7d8a20c0a677d01b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/