"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/610d214bcfa14387cd1c52b28a985704db506287/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:42:01Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:42:01Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"Say that CyApp.components is removed, not deprecated\n\ncytoscape/cytoscape-web#787 removed the field in App API 1.0.0-beta.5: the\nhost ignores it, and `ComponentType` is no longer exported, so an app that\nreferences it does not load. The note called it deprecated. The beta.4\ntypes this repository still depends on declare both, so the note, not the\ntype checker, is what keeps it out.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a02d9178ebd138451867b6491977ea5e6f73b249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/a02d9178ebd138451867b6491977ea5e6f73b249"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/610d214bcfa14387cd1c52b28a985704db506287","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists