alse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/17231b0d2ba17b9d35ce5c672d12fb29e7c81b6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T19:20:14Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T19:20:14Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"Name the resolver by its full path, and install before running a copy\n\nTwo points from the review of #18.\n\nCLAUDE.md referred to the runtime resolver as `runtime/mfRuntimePlugin.ts`,\nwhich is a path inside the SDK package, not one a reader can follow from\nthe repository root. It is packages/app-runtime/src/runtime/mfRuntimePlugin.ts.\n\n\"Creating a New App\" went from editing the files straight to `npm run dev`.\nThat works after `npm create cytoscape-app`, which installs dependencies\nitself, and fails in a copy of project-template/, which has none. The\ntemplate''s own README already has the `npm install`; the steps here and the\nchecklist in its design document now have it too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5dda319f0f45a03e4f7c0992a1e89f7f6106fa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/e5dda319f0f45a03e4f7c0992a1e89f7f6106fa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/17231b0d2ba17b9d35ce5c672d12fb29e7c81b6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/17231b0d2ba17b9d35ce5c672d12fb29e7c81b6d","node_id":"C_kwDOMaT2ftoAKDE3MjMxYjBkMmJhMTdiOWQzNWNlNWM2NzJkMTJmYjI5ZTdjODFiNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/436d286ef96001c61c44bb5df71bdf78ce7e3565","sha":"436d286ef96001c61c44bb5df71bdf78ce7e3565","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/436d286ef96001c61c44bb5df71bdf78ce7e3565"}],"sha":"17231b0d2ba17b9d35ce5c672d12fb29e7c81b6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/17231b0d2ba17b9d35ce5c672d12fb29e7c81b6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/436d286ef96001c61c44bb5df71bdf78ce7e3565/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:07:35Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:07:35Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"Bring the design docs and CLAUDE.md in line with the apps as they are\n\nThe per-app design documents described apps that no longer exist.\nnetwork-workflows listed two menu component files that were deleted in\nthe api-types 1.0.0-beta.4 migration and three host modules nothing\nimports; hello-world was called a panel-only app with one component;\nproject-template gave its federation name as `createNetwork` and told\nthe reader to edit the port and name in vite.config.ts. All three now\ndescribe the declared resources, the sources behind them and the host\nmodules each app imports, taken from the code.\n\nTwo of them still named the legacy `CyApp.components` field\n(`ComponentType.Menu` / `ComponentType.Panel`). No app here uses it, and\nthe host is about to remove it: a menu row can no longer render its own\ndialog, so an ''apps-menu'' entry is data and its UI opens through\n`apis.dialog.open`.\n\nCLAUDE.md had the same drift. Its sample imported package.json, which\nthe app sources warn against; it described a hand-written federation\nblock where every app now calls defineCyWebApp; it told agents to update\na remotes.d.ts that does not exist and to copy apps.local.json over\napps.json, which the host''s dev server makes unnecessary. It also\npointed at a parent ../CLAUDE.md that is not there.\n\nDocumentation only. No source, build or dependency change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15e81ee44e03dd1d5debee4f4f979dffee6c041c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/15e81ee44e03dd1d5debee4f4f979dffee6c041c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/436d286ef96001c61c44bb5df71bdf78ce7e3565","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/436d286ef96001c61c44bb5df71bdf78ce7e3565","node_id":"C_kwDOMaT2ftoAKDQzNmQyODZlZjk2MDAxYzYxYzQ0YmI1ZGY3MWJkZjc4Y2U3ZTM1NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/08c12c71a5804a2b128075a2f2e67df86638031e","sha":"08c12c71a5804a2b128075a2f2e67df86638031e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-ap