"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/b869b6581d9f7abeb6cbf320040055581c3665c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:43:23Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:43:23Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"Stop naming a scaffolder version in the stale-cache recovery\n\nThe exact-version example in troubleshooting.md said @0.4.0, which after\nthis release selects the scaffolder that still pins api-types beta.3 --\nthe failure the section is meant to recover from. Both the sample\nfresh-fetch line and the recovery command now use a placeholder, so the\nguide stops going stale on every release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd693fb4cbc078d7a7a7a62c50e1bc2148133185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/cd693fb4cbc078d7a7a7a62c50e1bc2148133185"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/b869b6581d9f7abeb6cbf320040055581c3665c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u