url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/e383c8f30d20e894b413c1a1fd7cf1a3d2facab3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:40:25Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:40:25Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"0.4.1: scaffold against api-types 1.0.0-beta.4\n\nThe 0.4.0 scaffolder pins the exact api-types 1.0.0-beta.3, so every\nproject it generates types against a host contract that no longer renders\nits Apps-menu entry: beta.4 rejects a component on that slot with APP9.\nThe migration already on development moved API_TYPES_VERSION to\n1.0.0-beta.4 and taught sync-templates to emit menuActions.ts instead of a\nmenu component; this release carries that to npm.\n\nPatch, not minor: the CLI, its flags and the five variants are unchanged.\nWhat changes is the host a generated project is written for.\n\napp-runtime stays at 0.4.0 -- nothing in it changed, SDK_VERSION is still\n^0.4.0, and the release workflow skips a version the registry already\nhas, so this is a scaffolder-only run.\n\nPre-flight per the runbook: build, verify:federation (28), typecheck and\n524 tests green; the tarball lists 58 files with menuActions.ts in the\nmenu and full variants and no old menu component; the publish dry run\nprints no auto-corrected warning; and a menu app scaffolded from the\npacked tarball outside the repository resolves api-types 1.0.0-beta.4\nand app-runtime 0.4.0, type-checks, builds, passes cyweb-app verify (27)\nand its tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf100ae9103285591fb88699533d37172e95b12d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/bf100ae9103285591fb88699533d37172e95b12d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/e383c8f30d20e894b413c1a1fd7cf1a3d2facab3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/e383c8f30d20e894b413c1a1fd7cf1a3d2facab3","node_id":"C_kwDOMaT2ftoAKGUzODNjOGYzMGQyMGU4OTRiNDEzYzFhMWZkN2NmMWEzZDJmYWNhYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/bd9d3e5029015a446f123bd8dabc75aa91f8a507","sha":"bd9d3e5029015a446f123bd8dabc75aa91f8a507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/bd9d3e5029015a446f123bd8dabc75aa91f8a507"}],"sha":"e383c8f30d20e894b413c1a1fd7cf1a3d2facab3","url":"https://api.github.com/r