0675bfee3b1b5303c70f33a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/c03c997258065cd8d67291503879210a4d1779dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:06:12Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T02:06:12Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"Finish the beta.4 doc migration where review found the old shape\n\nSix places still described the component-based Apps-menu entry after the\nmigration commit: the registerAll example in the registration guide, the\nApp Registry row and network-workflows project map that listed the deleted\nmenu components, the \"Menu component pattern\" heading in hello-world''s\nREADME, the project-template README that placed menuActions.ts under\nsrc/components/, and the AGENTS.md the scaffolder generates, whose rule\ntold an agent to wrap menu items in lazy() — which recreates exactly the\nresource beta.4 rejects with APP9. The generated guidance now distinguishes\na panel (a lazy component) from an apps-menu entry (label + onClick).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b01a4e449a6b3a2f36b216d3707331f44074f99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/2b01a4e449a6b3a2f36b216d3707331f44074f99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/c03c997258065cd8d67291503879210a4d1779dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/c03c997258065cd8d67291503879210a4d1779dc","node_id":"C_kwDOMaT2ftoAKGMwM2M5OTcyNTgwNjVjZDhkNjcyOTE1MDM4NzkyMTBhNGQxNzc5ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/e7f9757bb04bc0fd9d78d10712babea184402984","sha":"e7f9757bb04bc0fd9d78d10712babea184402984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/e7f9757bb04bc0fd9d78d10712babea184402984"}],"sha":"c03c997258065cd8d67291503879210a4d1779dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/c03c997258065cd8d67291503879210a4d1779dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/e7f9757bb04bc0fd9d78d10712babea184402984/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T01:39:43Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T01:39:43Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"Migrate to @cytoscape-web/api-types 1.0.0-beta.4\n\nThe host now renders ''apps-menu'' rows itself: an entry is `label` +\n`onClick(apis)`, and registering a `component` fails with APP9. Every\nexample that put a component on that slot is migrated, and the pins move\nfrom ^1.0.0-beta.3 to ^1.0.0-beta.4 with the lockfile.\n\nhello-world: NetworkSummaryMenuItem rendered its own MUI <Dialog> and\ndeferred handleClose so the dropdown stayed mounted underneath. It becomes\nmenuActions.tsx, which reads the summary through apis.workspace and opens\napis.dialog.open({ title, render }); the host owns the frame and\nNetworkSummaryDialog.tsx is the body, wired to the `close` the host passes\nto render. The second federated expose (''./NetworkSummaryMenuItem'') is\nremoved with the component — its rationale was the host mounting a hooks-\nusing menu component in its own tree, which no longer happens; nothing\nimported it; apps.manifest.json and the test that asserted its source file\nexisted are updated to match.\n\nnetwork-workflows and project-template: three menu components that were a\n<Typography> row around one API call become plain actions in\nmenuActions.ts. project-template''s additiveSelect gains the split edgeIds\nargument the beta.4 signature requires.\n\ncreate-cytoscape-app: API_TYPES_VERSION is now the exact 1.0.0-beta.4.\nsync-templates.mjs, which builds templates/ out of project-template, emits\nthe new resource shape, copies menuActions.ts instead of a menu component,\nand imports `lazy` only for variants that still render one (the menu-only\nvariant would otherwise import it unused).\n\nDocs: README, CLAUDE.md, the three guides, the per-app READMEs and the\nserena memory no longer describe MenuItemHostProps, handleClose or\ncloseOnAction except to say they are gone.\n\nVerified: typecheck and build clean across every workspace, 524 tests,\nverify:federation green for all four apps, and menu+full templates\nscaffolded from the packed CLI type-check, build and test with the beta.4\npin. Then at runtime against the host''s development branch (beta.4 code):\nall four apps enable without APP9, all four rows appear with their new\nlabels, both onClick actions add a network and the host closes the\ndropdown itself, the CX2 action fetches and creates a 135-node network,\nand the Network Summary dialog opens through apis.dialog.open with the\nhost''s Close \"X\" in the frame and the body''s own Close wired to render''s\n`close`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7d718134a729fcca274b5f0c404ae6c16abd565","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/a7d718134a729fcca274b5f0c404ae6c16abd565"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/e7f9757bb04bc0fd9d78d10712babea184402984","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/e7f9757bb04bc0fd9d78d10712babea184402984","node_id":"C_kwDOMaT2ftoAKGU3Zjk3NTdiYjA0YmMwZmQ5ZDc4ZDEwNzEyYmFiZWExODQ0MDI5ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/ccdfdbab21d1092aa700f15bce1e8c7243a89a7b","sha":"ccdfdbab21d1092aa700f15bce1e8c7243a89a7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/ccdfdbab21d1092aa700f15bce1e8c7243a89a7b"}],"sha":"e7f9757bb04bc0fd9d78d10712babea184402984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/e7f9757bb04bc0fd9d78d10712babea184402984"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/471f2ff2351eb26591bad4d7bb7a72cda6bf54c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T06:26:26Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T06:26:26Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"Wait for the registry in the read-back step, and stop npm''s publish warnings\n\nThe 0.4.0 release published both packages correctly and then failed on\nthe read-back step: it read the scaffolder''s packument 0.5 s after the\npublish returned, before the registry had rewritten it — the registry''s\nown `time` puts that version 54 s later. The runtime, read back 5.7 s\nafter its publish, was already there. Same defect class as the smoke\nstep''s CDN race fixed in #10, one step earlier.\n\n- Read-back now polls for the version''s existence (up to 5 minutes)\n  before asserting the tag. Only existence is waited for: a tag that\n  points elsewhere once the version is present still fails immediately.\n  Exercised locally against the live registry, and against a version that\n  does not exist\n- Both `bin` paths drop their leading `./`. npm 11.19 normalizes the path\n  and keeps the entry, but reports it as \"invalid and removed\"; the\n  published 0.4.0 manifests carry the normalized path and the bins work\n- The runtime''s `\"//prepack\"` note moves out of `scripts` to a top-level\n  `\"//scripts\"` key, since npm strips non-string script values with a\n  second auto-corrected warning. Neither package''s dry-run publish warns\n  now\n- Runbook §3e records the failure and the hand-run smoke; checklist\n  Phase 8 marks the publish and smoke items done\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8dea3e2f8d4bb748fa0f285cbd056d2e552f498","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/e8dea3e2f8d4bb748fa0f285cbd056d2e552f498"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/471f2ff2351eb26591bad4d7bb7a72cda6bf54c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/co