":"f773ca784709f2164decdf7a23d3c1b850220901","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/f773ca784709f2164decdf7a23d3c1b850220901"}],"sha":"d4c54e038bbfc7c65a4be7316cd05752cb5a06b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/d4c54e038bbfc7c65a4be7316cd05752cb5a06b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/f773ca784709f2164decdf7a23d3c1b850220901/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T01:23:48Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T01:23:48Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"Move claude-bridge out to its own repository\n\nIt was never an example. The other four apps are small enough to read in a\nsitting; claude-bridge carried a 57-tool MCP server driving the host over CDP,\nand the exception had already leaked into the machinery: `published: false` in\napps.manifest.json, excluded from the public site, and called an \"internal\ntool\" in the README''s own command list.\n\nIt now lives at https://github.com/keiono/cy-agent-bridge, extracted with\n`git subtree split` so its 29 commits and its ADRs came along. The federation\nid, the port and the package names are unchanged there, so nothing that\nalready points at the app breaks.\n\nRemoved here:\n- claude-bridge/ and design/apps/claude-bridge/\n- The workspace entry, the build:apps target, dev:claude-bridge, and the clean\n  path. apps.manifest.json and `workspaces` are cross-checked by\n  scripts/manifest.mjs, so both had to move together\n- The README command line and the .serena structure map\n\nDocuments split by tense. Forward-looking ones now point at the new repository:\nthe roadmap''s §1.2 asset list and E-4 (whose remaining work is that\nrepository''s), and the entry-point checklist''s \"four published, one internal\"\nclassification, which is simply \"four, all published\" now. The vite-migration\nand app-sdk documents are records of completed work measured against five\napps — rewriting them would falsify the measurements, so they stand.\n\nAlso corrected while counting: design/apps/README.md listed simple-menu/ and\nsimple-panel/, both deleted long ago, and three \"five apps\" claims.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"10d3a30544adc8ca5176b42fc057de366d0408ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/10d3a30544adc8ca5176b42fc057de366d0408ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/f773ca784709f2164decdf7a23d3c1b850220901","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https