7fdc8869ab3a15769"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/3440a87ee2d97afb8409c8ad308ceb6b94965fc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/3440a87ee2d97afb8409c8ad308ceb6b94965fc3","node_id":"C_kwDOMaT2ftoAKDM0NDBhODdlZTJkOTdhZmI4NDA5YzhhZDMwOGNlYjZiOTQ5NjVmYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commit/2986c443d46e53e30bd8735978f44326b89c390b","sha":"2986c443d46e53e30bd8735978f44326b89c390b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/2986c443d46e53e30bd8735978f44326b89c390b"}],"sha":"3440a87ee2d97afb8409c8ad308ceb6b94965fc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/3440a87ee2d97afb8409c8ad308ceb6b94965fc3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/commits/9383f9afb317ddaaeaab148fbc713832da95eadb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T06:29:47Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T06:30:05Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"Wait for npm on the path npm uses, and say what actually got installed\n\n0.4.0-next.1 published cleanly and the tag assertion passed; the run then failed\non its own last step, which had never executed before.\n\nThe step read the registry by two different routes. The read-back asks\nregistry.npmjs.org directly with a cache buster and saw the new tag. The smoke\ntest ran `npm install create-cytoscape-app@next`, which resolves through a CDN\nedge and npm''s own cache, and got the PREVIOUS `next` — 0.3.1, whose scaffolder\npins ^0.3.0. So the project built with the old SDK, its archive had no\ncy-manifest.json, and the step died in JSON.parse with \"Unexpected end of JSON\ninput\": a symptom three commands from the cause, naming nothing useful. The\ngiveaway was in the build log, where the packager printed \"15 files, ready to\nupload\" — the message 0.3.1 emits — instead of \"including cy-manifest.json\".\n\nAsserting a tag on one path and installing on another is the defect, so the wait\nnow runs through `npm view --prefer-online`, for both the tag and the runtime\nversion, before anything is installed. And the step asserts what landed — the\nscaffolder''s version, the runtime the scaffolded project resolved, and the\npresence of cy-manifest.json in the archive — so a stale resolve fails by name\nrather than as a parse error after a build that quietly used an old SDK.\n\nThe published artifacts were never wrong: installing 0.4.0-next.1 by hand\nproduces a correct archive, verified end to end against the real registry.\nNothing is republished, and no version number is burned.\n\nThe runbook records it, with the general form: a post-publish check is the one\nstep whose code has never run before it runs for real.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ae5cb944eba41ef7f140086f5c5851039ee7026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/trees/1ae5cb944eba41ef7f140086f5c5851039ee7026"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web-app-examples/git/commits/9383f9afb317ddaaeaab148fbc713832da95eadb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_adm