7f9bd4e77e9a1bedef13f3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/forum/commits/3aa5d3671b602a1177f9bd4e77e9a1bedef13f3e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/forum/commits/c43688fa2657b9eec78a00e3fba96fcd1af96814/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-05T05:34:35Z","email":"samuelengineer@fastmail.com","name":"Samuel Allan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-05T05:34:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: make upgrade (#226)\n\n* chore: make upgrade\n\nUpgrade all python dependencies using `make upgrade`.\nThis also fixes the `make compile-requirements` process;\nit was previously broken with unresolvable dependencies.\n\n* fix: fix minor bugs caught by updated type checker\n\n- `backend.get_thread` can return None. Unlikely in this case, but\n  possible if the thread was somehow deleted before being retrieved\n  again.\n- returning group_ids at the end of `get_group_ids_from_params` could\n  result in an unexpected type and value being returned, depending on\n  what sanitation has been done on the params.","tree":{"sha":"d8dc00e9ba4939abd4bdf5f832ec9c04b48767d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/forum/git/trees/d8dc00e9ba4939abd4bdf5f832ec9c04b48767d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/forum/git/commits/c43688fa2657b9eec78a00e3fba96fcd1af96814","verification":{"payload":"tree d8dc00e9ba4939abd4bdf5f832ec9c04b48767d4\nparent af0949b983c62cc8d08850ccdeeb939fefc2d2b3\nauthor Samuel Allan <samuelengineer@fastmail.com> 1757050475 +0930\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1757050475 +0500\n\nchore: make upgrade (#226)\n\n* chore: make upgrade\n\nUpgrade all python dependencies using `make upgrade`.\nThis also fixes the `make compile-requirements` process;\nit was previously broken with unresolvable dependencies.\n\n* fix: fix minor bugs caught by updated type checker\n\n- `backend.get_thread` can return None. Unlikely in this case, but\n  possible if the thread was somehow deleted before being retrieved\n  again.\n- returning group_ids at the end of `get_group_ids_from_params` could\n  result in an unexpected type and value being returned, depending on\n  what sanitation has been done on the params.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJounZrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQIIQAC5BD8U5SKiVzJxIWTjRbCvl\nWTql/Lo1KJmQQDiyonTtEzGFOcSZ+znoA3HuHQgg311kko73fNiFOeq/PRFEnXEw\n/BBW2UFMsaTLyzyX1O4D/6avK+GoeJ6K8dov+gmSsP3P2VgRbLdR9vx2qhhM2rj3\nFbFDIPcF3Z0Lse1oiI3e2hPOc45QrM2CfIY3sZfs+th7UVyUEsSxHuyPv4hC4bel\nrz40K6H7CFO1CinGfhQjErqdkjtfFhJg7HApSru6BHWmZJIx7sRL8dwlAmyfGX4d\n67+vmmv8hHwwyan68pulyA+0imC8ZGa96BudW+M0gr33tHyGrGyUWyNR4isrKQlU\ncIoyWcIjzES0Xv6+C3IyyM11EaiSO9QwppXvb0WLclR8tVSaPV/vWqwcddgubu0i\nrKlZBKHTeOXZi4aipEt7FfxgO+D3IsbVC4dl3FAp5W6mx3uKOGDPvnThocDDlLy6\nBH6JO5+f74jQRCXayx1t0cxq2sgiiwpK2M792oZv1fQoMHtfHGi4sP9h4ZTL7Su7\nxfb7UcZegGAWO0iPxas+0fA5F7CBwYnFNi73SBR6HAaHguprvQiVyiOq9UPFRbNr\nYVzHetl6JHz4gonmtU3ff23RrTK3DD3UYWaSFJC5rM6onX9Yocj/81zUR5XPy47m\njIKdvRzrVWMak9Zho8zU\n=fgTF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-09-05T05:34:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscript