},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T08:09:11Z","email":"zhijgu@ebay.com","name":"zhijgu"},"message":"chore: bump @ebay/muse-core to 2.0.6","tree":{"sha":"5f1d86808b50605fe96274f87f62ee0fa7df3b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/git/trees/5f1d86808b50605fe96274f87f62ee0fa7df3b63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/git/commits/3e7f6e66a51c201b63606a336cb91cc767600e20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/eBay/Muse/commit/3e7f6e66a51c201b63606a336cb91cc767600e20","node_id":"C_kwDOMbiM9doAKDNlN2Y2ZTY2YTUxYzIwMWI2MzYwNmEzMzZjYjkxY2M3Njc2MDBlMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eBay/Muse/commit/e5c5c258da44931a3599e27ed37c30ef7004c5a1","sha":"e5c5c258da44931a3599e27ed37c30ef7004c5a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/commits/e5c5c258da44931a3599e27ed37c30ef7004c5a1"}],"sha":"3e7f6e66a51c201b63606a336cb91cc767600e20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/commits/3e7f6e66a51c201b63606a336cb91cc767600e20"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/commits/e5c5c258da44931a3599e27ed37c30ef7004c5a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T08:02:12Z","email":"zhijgu@ebay.com","name":"zhijgu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T08:02:12Z","email":"zhijgu@ebay.com","name":"zhijgu"},"message":"fix: remove blocking cleanDeadFiles/freeupSpace from LruDiskCache constructor\n\nOn clusters with 3 pods x 3 processes sharing a NFS-backed PVC, the\nsynchronous recursive directory scan in cleanDeadFiles() blocked the\nevent loop for 12+ hours, preventing pods from passing readiness probes.\n\nChanges:\n- Remove cleanDeadFiles() + freeupSpace() from constructor (no longer\n  run automatically at startup)\n- Remove freeupSpace() from set() (no longer run on every cache write)\n- Add ENOENT guard in cleanEmptyFoldersRecursively() to handle concurrent\n  pod deletion races on shared PVCs gracefully\n\nBoth cleanDeadFiles() and freeupSpace() remain as explicit public APIs\nfor future admin endpoint or offline maintenance job invocation.","tree":{"sha":"436110e254e06260a9b74a7733b01aa252280b0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/git/trees/436110e254e06260a9b74a7733b01aa252280b0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/git/commits/e5c5c258da44931a3599e27ed37c30ef7004c5a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/eBay/Muse/commit/e5c5c258da44931a3599e27ed37c30ef7004c5a1","node_id":"C_kwDOMbiM9doAKGU1YzVjMjU4ZGE0NDkzMWEzNTk5ZTI3ZWQzN2MzMGVmNzAwNGM1YTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eBay/Muse/commit/b0f24efeab47618f72b722c402f7beee572034d7","sha":"b0f24efeab47618f72b722c402f7beee572034d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/commits/b0f24efeab47618f72b722c402f7beee572034d7"}],"sha":"e5c5c258da44931a3599e27ed37c30ef7004c5a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/commits/e5c5c258da44931a3599e27ed37c30ef7004c5a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/481738?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supnate/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supnate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supnate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supnate/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/supnate","id":481738,"login":"supnate","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTczOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supnate/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supnate/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supnate/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supnate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supnate/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://