committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45652948?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/glin7976","id":45652948,"login":"glin7976","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NjUyOTQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eBay/Muse/commit/de0999d464cee66981c895da372fb2aa86065df3","node_id":"C_kwDOMbiM9doAKGRlMDk5OWQ0NjRjZWU2Njk4MWM4OTVkYTM3MmZiMmFhODYwNjVkZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eBay/Muse/commit/e16d17fdad08ed766c4f82720e39af8225aeff6a","sha":"e16d17fdad08ed766c4f82720e39af8225aeff6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/commits/e16d17fdad08ed766c4f82720e39af8225aeff6a"}],"sha":"de0999d464cee66981c895da372fb2aa86065df3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/commits/de0999d464cee66981c895da372fb2aa86065df3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/895071?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eugef","id":895071,"login":"eugef","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NTA3MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/commits/49491e41a46ff21ba9877c5a65a9211ed51ff62f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T14:46:54Z","email":"efidelin@ebay.com","name":"Fidelin, Eugene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T14:46:54Z","email":"efidelin@ebay.com","name":"Fidelin, Eugene"},"message":"Prevent activeMatch from being forwarded to menu DOM elements\n\n## Summary\n\nFixes the following React warning produced when rendering menus with `activeMatch`:\n\n```text\nWarning: React does not recognize the `activeMatch` prop on a DOM element.\nIf you accidentally passed it from a parent component, remove it from the DOM element.\n```\n\n## Root cause\n\n`MetaMenu` uses the Muse-specific `activeMatch` property to calculate the active menu keys. After evaluating it, the original menu-item objects are passed to Ant Design unchanged.\n\nAnt Design/rc-menu does not recognize `activeMatch` as a menu property and forwards it to the underlying `<li>`, which triggers the React warning.\n\n## Fix\n\nBefore passing items to Ant Design, `MetaMenu` now recursively clones the menu tree and removes `activeMatch`.\n\nThe original internal items are retained for route matching, so existing active-menu behavior is unchanged. Recursive sanitization covers both top-level submenu items and nested children.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Added regression coverage for parent and nested menu items containing `activeMatch`.\n- Verified that unsanitized items produce the React warning while sanitized items do not.\n- Confirmed the `muse-lib-antd` production build succeeds.","tree":{"sha":"04d1b2d743259650fe54feb3ebb700d0f33d810f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/git/trees/04d1b2d743259650fe54feb3ebb700d0f33d810f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/git/commits/49491e41a46ff21ba9877c5a65a9211ed51ff62f","verification":{"payload":"tree 04d1b2d743259650fe54feb3ebb700d0f33d810f\nparent 096a33adddf28c6d6a84e66736c5b054154e79c8\nauthor Fidelin, Eugene <efidelin@ebay.com> 1787582814 +0200\ncommitter Fidelin, Eugene <efidelin@ebay.com> 1787582814 +0200\n\nPrevent activeMatch from being forwarded to menu DOM elements\n\n## Summary\n\nFixes the following React warning produced when rendering menus with `activeMatch`:\n\n```text\nWarning: React does not recognize the `activeMatch` prop on a DOM element.\nIf you accidentally passed it from a parent component, remove it from the DOM element.\n```\n\n## Root cause\n\n`MetaMenu` uses the Muse-specific `activeMatch` property to calculate the active menu keys. After evaluating it, the original menu-item objects are passed to Ant Design unchanged.\n\nAnt Design/rc-menu does not recognize `activeMatch` as a menu property and forwards it to the underlying `<li>`, which triggers the React warning.\n\n## Fix\n\nBefore passing items to Ant Design, `MetaMenu` now recursively clones the menu tree and removes `activeMatch`.\n\nThe original internal items are retained for route matching, so existing active-menu behavior is unchanged. Recursive sanitization covers both top-level submenu items and nested children.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Added regression coverage for parent and nested menu items containing `activeMatch`.\n- Verified that unsanitized items produce the React warning while sanitized items do not.\n- Confirmed the `muse-lib-antd` production build succeeds.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQjt46e/co8kdVyw00IVuS+QSam9gUCaoxZXgAKCRAIVuS+QSam\n9srhAQDZMxbGvqOsryyp5W2gNAn7vENG4Ra5NXZiWoeze9m8PQEAmejCGjhc/Xw/\nmDzkDyWbDPvdrals/Ok3fqJ8DpqaOAo=\n=S1jC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/895071?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eugef","id":895071,"login":"eugef","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NTA3MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eugef","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eBay/Muse/commit/49491e41a46ff21ba9877c5a65a9211ed51ff62f","node_id":"C_kwDOMbiM9doAKDQ5NDkxZTQxYTQ2ZmYyMWJhOTg3N2M1YTY1YTkyMTFlZDUxZmY2MmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eBay/Muse/commit/096a33adddf28c6d6a84e66736c5b054154e79c8","sha":"096a33adddf28c6d6a84e66736c5b054154e79c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/commits/096a33adddf28c6d6a84e66736c5b054154e79c8"}],"sha":"49491e41a46ff21ba9877c5a65a9211ed51ff62f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eBay/Muse/commits/49491e41a46ff21ba9877c5a65a9211ed51ff62f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45652948?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glin7976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/glin7976","i