","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/ec9e148c2de89b8a3502f42dc3b74eba925161fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T13:21:08Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T13:21:08Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"docs: multi-tenancy, platform-scaling, and repository/query-layer audit notes\n\nRecords the 2026-07-23/24 review of pkg/pdtenantdb + internal/backoffice\ntenant isolation, placement routing/capacity, k8s topology, and the\nrepository/query-layer''s SQL construction — MT1-MT16, PS1-PS12, RQ1-RQ4.\nIncludes resolution status for the items fixed the same session (MT2, MT8,\nRQ1-RQ4, MT1 Phase 1) so the notes reflect current state rather than only\nthe original findings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ACtqKmFqn5zcp4dNmF8MVD","tree":{"sha":"4deaa777b7fc002b3272aedbf28724c52be5a038","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/4deaa777b7fc002b3272aedbf28724c52be5a038"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/ec9e148c2de89b8a3502f42dc3b74eba925161fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/follow