llowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/3f9fd40918ec36956c065e56059e3977a62ee4e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T16:48:17Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T16:48:17Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"feat(frontend-v2): onboarding backbone M0/M1 + Angular Material migration\n\nBuilds the Angular onboarding backbone against the real backend and\nreplaces frontend-v2''s ported Tailwind/Flowbite design system with\nAngular Material + SCSS.\n\nOnboarding backbone (PZEP-0008):\n- M0: core/http (auth interceptor, refresh-on-401), core/storage\n  (token/tenant), core/auth (AuthService), src/environments/, /login\n  and /register routes.\n- M1: workspace chooser (OnboardingWorkspaceService, WorkspaceChooser),\n  wired into admin-home-page.\n\nAngular Material migration (ADR-0006, revised same session to cover a\nfull replacement rather than the originally-scoped 6 components):\n- ng add @angular/material (Material 3, SCSS, provideAnimationsAsync).\n- Removed Tailwind CSS, PostCSS-Tailwind config, Flowbite, and\n  tailwind-merge entirely.\n- Of 98 ported shared/ui components, only 13 were actually imported\n  anywhere; those were rewritten on Material primitives + component\n  SCSS, the other ~85 unused ones were deleted rather than migrated.\n- Added Badge, NavList (wired into shell), Tabs, and a generic\n  DataTable<T> to shared/ui ahead of M2/M3, based on concrete patterns\n  found in the SolidJS onboarding store-provisioning pages.\n- agent/ANGULAR_STYLE_GUIDE.md updated to reflect Material + SCSS as\n  frontend-v2''s UI approach.\n\nVerified: ng build (dev+prod), ng test, prettier format/format:check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0f6c4f901287f312bb21269e4cdf4c2f8b6fb93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/d0f6c4f901287f312bb21269e4cdf4c2f8b6fb93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/3f9fd40918ec36956c065e56059e3977a62ee4e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/3f9fd40918ec36956c065e56059e3977a62ee4e3","node_id":"C_kwDOMdFIKNoAKDNmOWZkNDA5MThlYzM2OTU2YzA2NWU1NjA1OWUzOTc3YTYyZWU0ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/b5f1b398c7338e34d27595fb385db81c972e5e2a","sha":"b5f1b398c7338e34d27595fb385db81c972e5e2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/b5f1b398c7338e34d27595fb385db81c972e5e2a"}],"sha":"3f9fd40918ec36956c065e56059e3977a62ee4e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/3f9fd40918ec36956c065e56059e3977a62ee4e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/b5f1b398c7338e34d27595fb385db81c972e5e2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:47:28Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:47:28Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"feat(frontend-v2): scaffold Angular app + port full design-system component library\n\nNew frontend-v2/ — Angular 22 evaluation/migration target (ADR-0005,\nPZEP-0004), standalone for now, not yet wired into the real host.\n\n- Angular CLI scaffold + native-federation remote config (port 3004)\n- Tailwind v4 + flowbite plugin, design tokens ported verbatim from\n  frontend/src/solid/global.css\n- Shell layout + onboarding feature stub, matching PodzoneNavbar.tsx''s\n  real structure/classes exactly (cross-checked against the earlier\n  root-vs-org-nav-mockup Artifact)\n- Full design-system port from frontend/packages/shared/ui: 86 component\n  folders, 98 .component.ts/.component.html pairs (display primitives,\n  collections/tables, overlays, navigation, forms, editors, typography,\n  toaster), all following a strict one-folder-per-component convention\n  with no inline templates — angular.json''s schematics defaults now\n  enforce this for future `ng generate component` calls too\n- Business logic and real page content intentionally not included —\n  scaffold and component library only (PZEP-0006, PZEP-0007)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e4a17201550800ef3cf262f9a41091521ca3285","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/8e4a17201550800ef3cf262f9a41091521ca3285"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/b5f1b398c7338e34d27595fb385db81c972e5e2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/b5f1b398c7338e34d27595fb385db81c972e5e2a","node_id":"C_kwDOMdFIKNoAKGI1ZjFiMzk4YzczMzhlMzRkMjc1OTVmYjM4NWRiODFjOTcyZTVlMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/5ed700b2a34a78b8bdcdebdcdc237603b8e48a5b","sha":"5ed700b2a34a78b8bdcdebdcdc237603b8e48a5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/5ed700b2a34a78b8bdcdebdcdc237603b8e48a5b"}],"sha":"b5f1b398c7338e34d27595fb385db81c972e5e2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/b5f1b398c7338e34d27595fb385db81c972e5e2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/5ed700b2a34a78b8bdcdebdcdc237603b8e48a5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:47:09Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:47:09Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"feat(frontend): migrate host + remotes to Module Federation 2, bridge Angular native-federation\n\nSwaps @originjs/vite-plugin-federation for @module-federation/vite on\nthe host and all 3 SolidJS remotes (backoffice, iam, onboarding) — same\nexposes/shared config, zero behavior change. Adds native-to-mf-bridge so\nthe host can load an Angular native-federation remote once one exists\n(PZEP-0005).\n\nFixes a real regression this migration would have caused: MF2 emits\nremoteEntry.js at the build output root, not under assets/ like the old\nplugin — updated the host''s default remote URLs and\ndeployments/docker/services.yml''s VITE_*_REMOTE_URL env vars to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42425219d086e9012f7b2b6505b1bbe350a7b9be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/42425219d086e9012f7b2b6505b1bbe350a7b9be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/5ed700b2a34a78b8bdcdebdcdc237603b8e48a5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/5ed700b2a34a78b8bdcdebdcdc237603b8e48a5b","node_id":"C_kwDOMdFIKNoAKDVlZDcwMGIyYTM0YTc4YjhiZGNkZWJkY2RjMjM3NjAzYjhlNDhhNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/a25dd8820f6b431765fe2098363ac296b1f1427f","sha":"a25dd8820f6b431765fe2098363ac296b1f1427f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/a25dd8820f6b431765fe2098363ac296b1f1427f"}],"sha":"5ed700b2a34a78b8bdcdebdcdc237603b8e48a5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/5ed700b2a34a78b8bdcdebdcdc237603b8e48a5b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/a25dd8820f6b431765fe2098363ac296b1f1427f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:46:53Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:46:53Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"docs: ADR-0005 + PZEP-0004/0005/0006/0007 — Angular frontend migration plan and Angular style guide\n\nAngular replaces SolidJS as the frontend target, migrated incrementally\nbehind the existing host (ADR-0005, PZEP-0004). Documents the real\nfinding that MF2 and Angular native-federation are separate ecosystems\nrequiring a bridge (PZEP-0005), the base Angular MFE scaffold work\n(PZEP-0006), and the full design-system port to Angular (PZEP-0007).\nagent/ANGULAR_STYLE_GUIDE.md is the new binding reference for frontend-v2/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70d377fd8250674d7aee38494a5a5a5d931c3f06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/70d377fd8250674d7aee38494a5a5a5d931c3f06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/a25dd8820f6b431765fe2098363ac296b1f1427f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/c