s/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/3dcbb21e1f84f7d6a25c0d73291e82529f8361f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T13:35:14Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T13:35:14Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"docs: split knowledge base by environment (local-dev/staging/prod)\n\nSame symptom can have a different cause depending on where it happens —\na Docker/WSL2 port-forward quirk only exists in local dev, a staging/prod\nincident never is that. Restructured docs/10-knowledge-base/:\n\ndocs/10-knowledge-base/\n  README.md          — index, links to the three environment folders\n  local-dev/\n    README.md         — index of local-dev entries\n    2026-07-11-mfe-remoteentry-empty-response.md   (moved, was flat)\n    2026-07-11-backoffice-graphql-404.md            (moved, was flat)\n  staging/README.md   — placeholder, no staging environment yet\n  prod/README.md       — placeholder, no prod environment yet\n\nFixed the one stale reference (14-mfe-federation-contract.md pointed at\nthe old flat path). The two moved entries'' cross-link to each other\nalready used a relative \"./\" path, so it stayed valid without editing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57550ffb8b26941cdd008b696f3398d616a00e52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/57550ffb8b26941cdd008b696f3398d616a00e52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/3dcbb21e1f84f7d6a25c0d73291e82529f8361f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer"