llowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/aa05a792411afb9da88d2175fc258de96716e839/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:58:19Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:58:19Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"feat(mfe): sprint 4 — move backoffice pages to apps/backoffice/, fix remote build\n\n- Move all 7 backoffice page trees from frontend/src/modules/backoffice/pages/\n  to frontend/apps/backoffice/src/pages/ (git history preserved)\n- Set root: __dirname in remote vite.config so the remote build uses\n  apps/backoffice/index.html as entry, not frontend/index.html — prevents\n  Rollup from pulling in app-router.tsx → routes.ts → unresolvable\n  backoffice/* imports\n- Update routes.ts fallback imports from relative ./pages/ to @backoffice/pages/\n- Update tsconfig.app.json to include apps/backoffice/src in compilation\n- Add APISIX service 130 and route 1025 (/mfe/backoffice/*) in seed.sh\n- Add backoffice-remote service to services.yml with hot-reload volumes\n- Add VITE_BACKOFFICE_REMOTE_URL env and depends_on to frontend service\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfd73436d7353a6ad8a7186fb7281e4dc6fb9cf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/bfd73436d7353a6ad8a7186fb7281e4dc6fb9cf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/aa05a792411afb9da88d2175fc258de96716e839","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/aa05a792411afb9da88d2175fc258de96716e839","node_id":"C_kwDOMdFIKNoAKGFhMDVhNzkyNDExYWZiOWRhODhkMjE3NWZjMjU4ZGU5NjcxNmU4Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/0885de40f2e4130089b7d6562517308682f0ff38","sha":"0885de40f2e4130089b7d6562517308682f0ff38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/0885de40f2e4130089b7d6562517308682f0ff38"}],"sha":"aa05a792411afb9da88d2175fc258de96716e839","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/aa05a792411afb9da88d2175fc258de96716e839"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/0885de40f2e4130089b7d6562517308682f0ff38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:41:41Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:41:41Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"feat(fe-arch): sprint 3 — MFE runtime switch + backoffice remote Docker service\n\nRUNTIME SWITCH:\nroutes.ts now uses inline __MFE_BACKOFFICE__ ternaries so Rollup can\ntree-shake the dead branch at build time:\n  - VITE_BACKOFFICE_REMOTE_URL unset → __MFE_BACKOFFICE__=false → local\n    pages bundled in the monolith (Docker dev unchanged)\n  - VITE_BACKOFFICE_REMOTE_URL set → __MFE_BACKOFFICE__=true → all 7\n    backoffice page chunks removed from host; loaded from remote at runtime\n\nVerified: MFE build emits zero TenantXxxPage-*.js chunks; monolith build\nemits all 7 as before.\n\nVITE DEFINE:\nvite.config.ts adds define: { __MFE_BACKOFFICE__ } evaluated from\nprocess.env at server/build start — declared in federation.d.ts.\n\nREMOTE DOCKER SERVICE:\n- deployments/docker/Dockerfile.backoffice-dev — node:24-alpine image\n- backoffice-remote service in services.yml mounts the same frontend/\n  volume, runs npm run serve:backoffice (build:backoffice + preview on\n  port 3001 with CORS)\n- frontend service gains VITE_BACKOFFICE_REMOTE_URL env var\n  (default: http://localhost:3001/assets/remoteEntry.js)\n\napps/backoffice/vite.config.ts gains preview: { port:3001, cors:true }\npackage.json adds serve:backoffice script.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b23428582f08bd6ead2ab3c5706efe2dab342738","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/b23428582f08bd6ead2ab3c5706efe2dab342738"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/0885de40f2e4130089b7d6562517308682f0ff38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/0885de40f2e4130089b7d6562517308682f0ff38","node_id":"C_kwDOMdFIKNoAKDA4ODVkZTQwZjJlNDEzMDA4OWI3ZDY1NjI1MTczMDg2ODJmMGZmMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/7cfbe4067197eefc3b02d62b24c90f62e0b4acbc","sha":"7cfbe4067197eefc3b02d62b24c90f62e0b4acbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/7cfbe4067197eefc3b02d62b24c90f62e0b4acbc"}],"sha":"0885de40f2e4130089b7d6562517308682f0ff38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/0885de40f2e4130089b7d6562517308682f0ff38"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/7cfbe4067197eefc3b02d62b24c90f62e0b4acbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:34:39Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:34:39Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"feat(fe-arch): sprint 2 — Module Federation infrastructure (host + backoffice remote)\n\nInstalls @originjs/vite-plugin-federation and wires up the MFE split:\n\nHOST (frontend/vite.config.ts):\n- federation({ name: ''shell'', remotes: { backoffice } })\n- VITE_BACKOFFICE_REMOTE_URL env var controls remote URL\n  (defaults to localhost:3001 for local dev)\n- Shared: solid-js, @tanstack/solid-router (deduplicated at runtime)\n\nREMOTE (apps/backoffice/vite.config.ts):\n- Standalone Vite build exposing all 7 backoffice pages as federation modules:\n  ./TenantHomePage, ./TenantOrdersPage, ./TenantOrderAuditPage,\n  ./TenantOrderFinancePage, ./TenantPartnersPage, ./TenantPartnerDetailPage,\n  ./TenantProductSetupPage\n- @/ alias resolves to frontend/src (no source move needed yet)\n- Builds to apps/backoffice/dist with remoteEntry.js\n\nBuild scripts added:\n  npm run build:backoffice  — builds the remote\n  npm run build:all         — remote first, then host\n  npm run preview:backoffice — serves remote on port 3001\n\nType declarations (src/federation.d.ts) for all remote module imports.\n\nMonolith build unchanged — routes.ts keeps local imports so Docker dev\nworks without a running remote server. Switch to federation imports\n(import(''backoffice/TenantHomePage'')) when deploying the split build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39d103b7a201c67aaff508e29885e75f9368cc18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/39d103b7a201c67aaff508e29885e75f9368cc18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/7cfbe4067197eefc3b02d62b24c90f62e0b4acbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/7cfbe4067197eefc3b02d62b24c90f62e0b4acbc","node_id":"C_kwDOMdFIKNoAKDdjZmJlNDA2NzE5N2VlZmMzYjAyZDYyYjI0YzkwZjYyZTBiNGFjYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/27b26f31d462d552551295037a0075140d194293","sha":"27b26f31d462d552551295037a0075140d194293","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/27b26f31d462d552551295037a0075140d194293"}],"sha":"7cfbe4067197eefc3b02d62b24c90f62e0b4acbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/7cfbe4067197eefc3b02d62b24c90f62e0b4acbc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/27b26f31d462d552551295037a0075140d194293/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:25:04Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:25:04Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"fix(onboarding): P4/P6/P7 — audit phantom, TOCTOU double-fetch, double-provision race\n\nP7: ClaimNextQueued now only filters on Queued status; removes Planning from\nthe filter to prevent a second worker from re-claiming a lease-expired Planning\nrecord and double-provisioning it.\n\nP4: claimNext uses SetReturnDocument(Before) so request.Status reflects the\npre-update value; ProvisionNextStoreRequest derives the audit ''from'' field\nfrom request.Status instead of a hardcoded Queued constant, eliminating the\nphantom audit entry when re-claiming an expired Planning record.\n\nP6: ReconcileTenantPlacement no longer calls GetTenantPlacementAllocation\ntwice (once inside GetTenantPlacementStatus, once for PublishPlacementRoute).\nA private fetchPlacementState helper consolidates both DB calls into one\nround-trip and threads the result through both read and write paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a58f368ad3ccb1b3e28d9315076ea9bf713e59b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/9a58f368ad3ccb1b3e28d9315076ea9bf713e59b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/27b26f31d462d552551295037a0075140d194293","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/27b26f31d462d552551295037a0075140d194293","node_id":"C_kwDOMdFIKNoAKDI3YjI2ZjMxZDQ2MmQ1NTI1NTEyOTUwMzdhMDA3NTE0MGQxOTQyOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99/podzone/commit/73be9f536536ea26997d9832bd677d9ce7a7b8f5","sha":"73be9f536536ea26997d9832bd677d9ce7a7b8f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/73be9f536536ea26997d9832bd677d9ce7a7b8f5"}],"sha":"27b26f31d462d552551295037a0075140d194293","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/27b26f31d462d552551295037a0075140d194293"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuannm99","id":81021902,"login":"tuannm99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDIxOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/73be9f536536ea26997d9832bd677d9ce7a7b8f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:19:01Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:19:01Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"fix(onboarding): P1/P2/P3/P5 from known problems doc\n\nP1 health.go: replace LIKE schemaPrefix+% with starts_with() so the\nunderscore in t_ is not treated as a SQL wildcard, fixing inflated\nschema counts used by placement planner.\n\nP2 interactor.go: remove ErrAccessDenied when authorizer==nil and\nownerID!=requestedBy. Without an authorizer wired (dev/bootstrap mode),\nowner overrides are permitted. Fixes broken bootstrap seeding.\n\nP3 interactor.go + worker: FinalizeNextStoreRequest now returns\nErrRouteNotReady (not nil) when route is not ready and lease is\nreleased. Worker tick() continues instead of breaking on this sentinel,\npreventing provisioning starvation when one item blocks the queue.\n\nP5 health.go: exclude the health-check''s own connection from\npg_stat_activity by filtering pid <> pg_backend_pid(), fixing the\noff-by-one in CurrentConnections.\n\nTests updated to reflect new semantics.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"857dda760e4e76ada837058c3663219d887d1fc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/857dda760e4e76ada837058c3663219d887d1fc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/73be9f536536ea26997d9832bd677d9ce7a7b8f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/events{/privac