nnm99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/33c8a5fc313b4d0f824057b9660ade3c270a118c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:59:34Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:59:34Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"refactor(fe-arch): sprint 1c — module-scoped route trees, packages/shared scaffold, pnpm workspace\n\n1c.1: Each module exports createRouteTree<TParent>(parent, guards) returning its\nroute array. app-router.tsx is now a thin composer: defines rootRoute, auth\nguards, and mounts subtrees from each module. Only path string left in\napp-router.tsx is ''/''.\n\n1c.2: frontend/packages/shared/ with three typed re-export surfaces:\n  - auth/index.ts  → AuthContext + useAuthContext\n  - services/index.ts → typed API client wrappers\n  - ui/index.ts → design system components\n\n1c.3: pnpm-workspace.yaml declares apps/* and packages/* workspaces.\nStub package.json files added for @podzone/backoffice and @podzone/shared.\nRoot Vite build unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bccd8076888f54ab7231657a2650361655393dc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/bccd8076888f54ab7231657a2650361655393dc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/33c8a5fc313b4d0f824057b9660ade3c270a118c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81021902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tua