m99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuannm99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/commits/1a51d7916d72e3f9752c5dfffd959949fc30610d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T16:44:59Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T16:44:59Z","email":"gm.tuannm99@gmail.com","name":"tuannm99"},"message":"fix(vibe): pkg - fix 11 correctness bugs across messaging, tenantdb, kvstore, and infra\n\nK1: add ctx to KVStore interface; thread caller context through MongoStore (5s cap)\nK2: expose CloseIdleDedicated on Manager interface; wire periodic janitor via fx.Lifecycle\nK3: waitUntilReady re-publishes large-delay retries instead of blocking Sarama partition goroutine\nK4: malformed envelope now drops+observes instead of breaking consumer group session\nK5: InboxStore.Begin retries INSERT on ErrNoRows to close delete-between-steps race\nK6: Registry.Handle returns error for unregistered message types instead of silent nil\nK7: IdempotentConsumer returns error on empty msg.ID instead of silently bypassing deduplication\nK8: Relay.RunOnce batches MarkPublished into one call after the publish loop\nK9: pdconfig uses os.Expand with safe mapper; unknown $VAR placeholders preserved intact\nK10: CORS AllowOriginFunc uses HasSuffix on allowlist instead of Contains on dev username\nK11: remove dead _ = time.Second from pdredis lifecycle\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d72af60122c60baefc987079df28b9cf2d149204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/trees/d72af60122c60baefc987079df28b9cf2d149204"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tuannm99/podzone/git/commits/1a51d7916d72e3f9752c5dfffd959949fc30610d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified